  "body": "## Bathcat delivery\n\nComplete immutable `ready_for_audit` packet for **Onirim Second Edition**, English Z-Man SKU ZM4900 / BGG 156336. Base game only; all included expansions are excluded from operative claims.\n\n- Bathcat head: `9b886ed3bd1df742fef4d167a36d92001116ef82`\n- Parent main: `c73e4be1bf88672e29996f3932bcc263fe0cc235`\n- Packet SHA-256: `a358b9d42036c28be1c9389f113ded706f9384a89c58e35df2a87299327ef1e0`\n- Run: `2026-08-01-onirim-second-edition`\n- Slug: `onirim-second-edition`\n\n## Evidence boundary\n\n- Official ZM4900 rulebook: `https://d3sr78rmtg4mfy.cloudfront.net/filer_public/fd/0e/fd0ef6a2-c019-47a2-910a-a556f03a3d02/zm4900_onirim_rules.pdf` \u2014 HTTP 200, 3,667,165 bytes, 7 pages, SHA-256 `f146783bc8f5e39b97382a04f610615b05aab4306303cca8312d235c64638579`.\n- Independent review: `https://coopboardgames.com/cooperative-board-game-reviews/onirim-second-edition-review/` \u2014 HTTP 200, SHA-256 `b1ebeeaaee9de184f45cbddfb4bd4ba8b53475b058d8190ab612f22180d9c520`.\n- Two distinct source-linked visual assets and an inspected contact sheet are staged with exact receipts.\n- No rating claim is published.\n\n## Gates\n\n- package/schema validation clean\n- intake/provenance/history suite: 43 active passed, 1 intentional skip, 0 failed\n- full OKF validation before commit: 2,625 files clean; index fresh\n- ordinary committed-head intake validation: clean\n- `git diff --check`: clean\n- local/tracking/remote head equality verified\n\nBathcat authored no approval, promotion, canonical `games/` write, or merge. A fresh Mennonite must reopen sources and audit exact head `9b886ed3bd1df742fef4d167a36d92001116ef82`. The PR check is expected to remain non-mergeable while this is an intermediate `ready_for_audit` head; only Mennonite approval and deterministic promotion may make the synthetic-merge gate green.",
